- `this.camera.fov` menu vs game. If state changes, updateProjectionMatrix. In `updateMenuCamera`, set fov 58 if different. On play, set settings.fov. In `applySettings` handles when playing; but when entering menu after playing, need fov 58. Set in updateMenuCamera. And on play, set to settings.fov. Add `this.camera.fov = 58; updateProjectionMatrix()` when menu; when playing set in play(). Good.

- `updateMenuCamera(dt)`:
```
this.menuAngle += dt*0.045;
const s=this.world?.size || 96;
const cx=s/2, cz=s/2;
const r=58;
this.camera.position.set(cx+Math.cos(this.menuAngle)*r, 31+Math.sin(this.menuAngle*1.7)*2.5, cz+Math.sin(this.menuAngle)*r);
